  hDialogLines:
  - text: "Oh, hello there, You must be new around here. Welcome to my kitchen! I\u2019m
      Kriss."
  - text: "Everyone in the barrio knows me for my cooking I\u2019ve been making delicious
      Filipino dishes for as long as I can remember!"
  - text: "Cooking isn\u2019t just about filling the stomach, you know. It\u2019s
      about sharing love, preserving traditions, and making memories."
  - text: "today, I\u2019ll teach you one of our most beloved dishes adobo"
